cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its findings, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Taxi-out Time as a Database Record: code for the PRC Data Challenge 2026, team quick-boat"
abstract: >-
  Taxi-out time prediction for ten European airports, built on the finding that the target is an airport database
  record rather than a measurement: a regression blend, an ADS-B trajectory stage, and rules read from how the
  records are written. The paper is analysis/joas/main.pdf.
authors:
